        "name": "role_named",
        "parameters": "[{\"name\": \"m\", \"type\": \"EnvModel\", \"required\": true}, {\"name\": \"e\", \"type\": \"Entry\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"the entry naming the role\"}, {\"name\": \"attr\", \"type\": \"str\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"its attribute holding a binding role (ciamFindingsRole, ciamAlertRole, ...)\"}]",
        "purpose": "The binding of environment m whose role entry e's attribute attr names (one_role of that role), or None when e names none or m binds nothing with it: the shared 'binding of the role an attribute names' lookup (findings and results destinations, alert channels, audit trail destinations and streams, login secrets, backup vaults, snapshot policies, collection credentials). Pure.",
