    {
      "attributes": {
        "description": "User-approved 2026-10-15 (asked to give idle workers the role_named task). Found by worker-2 in task 514 (notes 3003, 3004): the same 2 lines 'the binding of the role an attribute names' (one_role(m, one(e, attr))) at 9 sites: estate security.py:55 findings_destination, budgets.py:33, discovery.py:70 (destination); observability audit.py:56 (trail_destination) and :74; infrastructure appliances.py:25; data backups.py:39, volumes.py:54; governance collection.py:24. Change: core opsdir/opsdir/core/environment.py role_named(m, e, attr), public, documented, tested; the sites switch; discovery.destination stays as a public wrapper (aws and gcp import it). Behaviour-neutral, byte-identical. Rules 2991 + 3002. Boundary: core/environment.py (add the function at the end of the file only: task 520, not yet merged, adds EnvModel.cluster_discovery and helpers in the same file), the 9 domain files, their tests, opsdir/README.md shared-API line.",
        "flows": [
          "Showcase & Verification"
        ],
        "name": "U.14 h: core role_named helper for the 9 'binding of the role an attribute names' sites",
